Description: remote HbbTV transcoder for VDR
 remotetranscode works with vdr-plugin-web and cefbrowser to provide HbbTV
 broadband media playback, DASH conversion and MSE transport for VDR.
 .
 This package is built from the rellla fixes integration used by the
 VDR-Suite HbbTV stack.
